### Extensión "REST Client": clic en "Send Request" sobre cada bloque

### 1. SINPE Móvil (nace CAPTURED)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-sinpe-1

{"amount":5000,"currency":"CRC","method":{"type":"SINPE_MOVIL","phone":"88887777"}}

### 2. Tarjeta (nace AUTHORIZED)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-card-1

{"amount":25.50,"currency":"USD","method":{"type":"CARD","token":"tok_visa","brand":"VISA"}}

### 3. Tarjeta rechazada
POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-card-declined

{"amount":10,"currency":"USD","method":{"type":"CARD","token":"tok_declined"}}

### 4. Transferencia (queda PENDING)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-bank-1

{"amount":100,"currency":"USD","method":{"type":"BANK_TRANSFER","iban":"CR05015202001026284066"}}

### 5. Capturar (reemplaza ID por el paymentId de la tarjeta)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/REEMPLAZAR_ID/capture

### 6. Reembolsar (reemplaza ID por un pago CAPTURED)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/REEMPLAZAR_ID/refund
